RSAqaW5zdHJlYW0pIHsKICAgICBpZiAoaSA+PSAwICYmCiAgICAgICAgIGlncmFwaF9nbWxfdHJl
ZV90eXBlKGNvbnRleHQudHJlZSwgaSkgPT0gSUdSQVBIX0lfR01MX1RSRUVfSU5URUdFUiAmJgog
ICAgICAgICBpZ3JhcGhfZ21sX3RyZWVfZ2V0X2ludGVnZXIoY29udGV4dC50cmVlLCBpKSAhPSAx
KSB7Ci0gICAgICAgIGlncmFwaF9nbWxfdHJlZV9kZXN0cm95KGNvbnRleHQudHJlZSk7CiAgICAg
